Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(product-trial): Take init_telemetry from
 press.utils.telemetry

Frappe v16 removed frappe.utils.telemetry.init_telemetry, so the
product_trial_request module fails to import on v16 with ImportError.
Press already ships the same helper in press/utils/telemetry.py. It
reads posthog_host and posthog_project_id and does nothing when they
are unset. Kept the call sites as they are, since the helper has the
same contract.

